Id: pwp001w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_passwd
Controls: CIS 5.1, 5.2; NIST AC-2, IA-5(1); ISO 5.16, 5.17; CE User access control

Passwords never expire: MAXWEEKS is unset in
/etc/default/passwd, so a stolen password works until someone
notices. Give passwords a lifetime (MAXWEEKS=13 is thirteen
weeks).
